    displayText: "The Spoliarium is Juan Luna\u2019s most enormous artwork in the
      Philippines. This monumental work of art won the gold medal during the 1884
      Madrid Exposition of Fine Arts."
  - imageName: The Assassination of Governor Bustamante
    displayText: "This painting is Hidalgo\u2019s interpretation of a violent and
      historical event involving Fernando Bustamante and the Spanish friars in Manila
      during the Spanish colonial period."
  uiText: {fileID: 965677771}
